      "message": "Patch Set 1:\n\n(3 comments)\n\nAI code review results below, please doublecheck\n\nLooks good; the removal is complete and the remaining GNI references are only the NID-parsing ones the commit message says are kept. A couple of optional nits inline for whenever it is next refreshed, no need to re-spin for them. One leftover outside the diff: the LB2_LINUX_CONFTEST_MAKEFILE header in config/lustre-build-linux.m4 still describes $3 as \"external kernel includes for lnet o2ib|gni\".",
